{"comment_text": {"ja47:0.1": "", "ja47:0.2": "", "ja47:0.3": "", "ja47:0.4": "", "ja47:1.1": "The brewer’s apprentice ruins a batch of toddy due to misunderstanding the instructions. ", "ja47:1.2": "", "ja47:1.3": "", "ja47:1.4": "", "ja47:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja47:0.1": "<article id='ja47'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja47:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja47:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja47:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja47:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja47:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja47:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja47:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja47:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja47:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja47:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja47:0.3": "Atthakāmavagga ", "ja47:0.4": "7. Vāruṇidūsakajātaka ", "ja47:1.1": "“Na ve anatthakusalena, ", "ja47:1.2": "atthacariyā sukhāvahā; ", "ja47:1.3": "Hāpeti atthaṁ dummedho, ", "ja47:1.4": "koṇḍañño vāruṇiṁ yathā”ti. ", "ja47:2.1": "Vāruṇidūsakajātakaṁ sattamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja47:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 47 ", "ja47:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja47:0.3": "Wanting to Help ", "ja47:0.4": "Spoiling the Toddy: a past life story ", "ja47:1.1": "Surely not with one who misunderstands the meaning ", "ja47:1.2": "does good conduct lead to happiness. ", "ja47:1.3": "The simpleton destroys the good, ", "ja47:1.4": "as Koṇḍañña did the toddy. ", "ja47:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja47:0.1": "", "ja47:0.2": "", "ja47:0.3": "", "ja47:0.4": "", "ja47:1.1": "", "ja47:1.2": "", "ja47:1.3": "", "ja47:1.4": "", "ja47:2.1": "Vāruṇidūsakajātakaṁ → vāruṇijātakaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja47:0.1": "", "ja47:0.2": "", "ja47:0.3": "", "ja47:0.4": "", "ja47:1.1": "bj30.20, csp1ed22.12, csp2ed22.12, ms22J_102, msdiv47, pts-vp-pli1.252", "ja47:1.2": "", "ja47:1.3": "", "ja47:1.4": "", "ja47:2.1": "ms22J_103"}, "keys_order": ["ja47:0.1", "ja47:0.2", "ja47:0.3", "ja47:0.4", "ja47:1.1", "ja47:1.2", "ja47:1.3", "ja47:1.4", "ja47:2.1"]}